    "detailed_description": "<h1>Coming soon - Grunn!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Moeras is a short action-adventure game about an archer that's guarding a swamp.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135070/extras/293c2b2ba5ee0899590be5bf0f63adbd.poster.avif?t=1726498004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135070/extras/293c2b2ba5ee0899590be5bf0f63adbd.webm?t=1726498004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135070/extras/293c2b2ba5ee0899590be5bf0f63adbd.mp4?t=1726498004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 10-15 minutes of gameplay.<br></li><li> Cool archery mechanic.<br></li><li> Procedural animations.<br></li><li> A big swamp, and a beach.</li></ul><br><strong>Controls</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> WASD keys to move.<br></li><li> Move the mouse to rotate the camera.<br></li><li> Left mouse button to shoot.</li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1135070/extras/c350ac25322f0cc81d29044611c576b9.avif?t=1726498004\" /></div><br>Sokpop makes a new game every two weeks!<br>Subscribe for 3$ per month at ",
